<title>INDIA: India issues 50 bln rupees of government stock.</title>
<headline>India issues 50 bln rupees of government stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government on Wednesday announced the issue of 13.05 percent Government Stock 2007 (Second Issue) for an amount of 50 billion rupees to the Reserve Bank of India on a private placement basis.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Stock will be issued on April 23, 1997, and will be eligible for ready forward facility,&quot; the Finance Ministry statement said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
